# PROJECT: DOORBLY REMOTE EMPLOYEE WORKSTATION & MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Develop a complete, modern, professional, responsive web application named:

**DOORBLY – Remote Employee Workstation & Management System**

Website: `workstation.doorbly.com`

The application will be used by Doorbly employees working remotely across all 30 districts of Odisha, India.

This must be a fully functional business application, not a static dashboard, UI prototype, or demo application.

Build one centralized web application with individual employee workspaces. Every employee must see a personalized dashboard according to their employee ID, department, designation, reporting manager and assigned district.

The system must connect employees, department heads, District Coordinators, District Managers and Central Administration.

### Main business objectives

1. Manage remote employees across Odisha.
2. Assign daily tasks automatically or manually.
3. Monitor employee attendance and productivity.
4. Manage customer lead generation.
5. Manage residential and corporate enquiries.
6. Manage service-provider onboarding.
7. Monitor customer bookings and completed services.
8. Track department-wise work submissions.
9. Verify completed tasks and award productivity credits.
10. Monitor district-wise revenue.
11. Achieve a combined daily service-subtotal target of ₹1,00,000 across 30 districts.
12. Generate automatic daily, weekly and monthly reports.

